## Junior Camp

**Entering 4th-6th Grade**

{% sessionCapacity sessions=["Junior 1", "Junior 2"] /%}

**Junior Camp 1**: June 14–19 | **Junior Camp 2**: July 5–10

$440 ($390 before 4/14)

Full-week adventure for elementary students! Junior Campers enjoy a full schedule of activities — Worship, Bible Study, games (like Melee), waterfront fun, crafts, campfires, and more — all while building mentor relationships and friendships.

{% ctaButton
   label="Register Now"
   href="https://www.ultracamp.com/clientlogin.aspx?idCamp=1342&campCode=OTY"
   variant="inverse"
   size="lg"
   align="left"
   textColor="accent" /%}
{% /gridSquare %}

